  "text": "Animal Hospital in West Springfield, MA | Veterinary Emergency & Specialty Hospitals (VESH)\nSkip to Primary Content\nFind a Location\nContact Us\nCareers\nER Check-In\n(413) 665-4911\nAbout Us\nOur Story\nSouth Deerfield Team\nWest Springfield Team\nServices\n24/7 Emergency\nAvian & Exotics\nCardiology\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nOncology\nSurgery\nUrgent Care\nAll Services\nPet Owners\nCheck-In\nPrescription Refills\nFor Veterinarians\nReferral Information\nReferral Portal\nClinical Trials\nFind a Location\nEmergency\nWelcome to VESH West Springfield\n134 Capital Drive, West Springfield, MA 01089\nServices\nVeterinary Emergency & Specialty Hospital is equipped with the most advanced diagnostic and medical equipment to support pets that require emergency treatment, advanced procedures, specialist treatment, or surgery.\nView Our Services >\nEmergency & Critical Care\nDiagnostic Imaging\nInternal Medicine\nSurgery\nAbout VESH West Springfield\nVeterinary Emergency & Specialty Hospital (VESH) West Springfield is a 24-hour emergency and specialty animal hospital just a few minutes off I-91 – serving West Springfield, Springfield, Holyoke, and the surrounding Pioneer Valley communities. Our 12,000 sq. ft. facility is equipped with state-of-the-art technology and staffed by a compassionate and skilled medical team.\nMeet Our Team\nWest Springfield Team\nOur Facility Features\nBrand new helical CT\nFluoroscopy\nEndoscopy\nUltrasound\nDigital radiography\nIn-house laboratory\nFully equipped ICU with:\nOxygen cage\nMonitoring equipment\nFluid pumps\nFull blood services\nSurgery suites with advanced equipment, including:\nVentilators\nAnesthesia machine\nPatient monitoring equipment\nAnd much more!\nVESH Hospital Tour\nGive Us A Call\nPhone:\n(413) 665-4911\nFax:\n(413) 665-4934\nHours of Operation\nMain Hours\nMon\nOpen 24 hrs\nTue\nOpen 24 hrs\nWed\nOpen 24 hrs\nThu\nOpen 24 hrs\nFri\nOpen 24 hrs\nSat\nOpen 24 hrs\nSun\nOpen 24 hrs\nAbout Us\nOur South Deerfield Team\nOur West Springfield Team\nCareers\nAll Services\nEmergency\n©\nCopyright\n2026\nAccessibility\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms & Conditions\nContact Us\nCookie Preferences\n©\nCopyright\n2026",
